flowchart TD
  A([Student submits grievance]) --> B[Validate input and store record]
  B --> C[AI triage: TF-IDF, classifier, urgency, sentiment, topic]
  C --> D[Save prediction, confidence, priority and explanation]
  D --> E{Confidence >= threshold?}
  E -- Yes --> F[Auto-route to predicted department]
  E -- No --> G[Place in unrouted intake queue]
  G --> H[Staff reviews AI suggestion and routes]
  F --> I[Start first-response and resolution SLA timers]
  H --> I
  I --> J{Category correct?}
  J -- No --> K[Staff overrides category and re-routes; audit log]
  K --> I
  J -- Yes --> L[Staff acknowledges: status in progress]
  L --> M{SLA deadline passed?}
  M -- Yes --> N[Record breach and trigger escalation]
  N --> O
  M -- No --> O[Work on case, comment with student]
  O --> P[Resolve with resolution note]
  P --> Q[Close after student confirmation]
  Q --> R[(Grievance corpus)]
  R --> S[LDA topics and weekly spike detection]
  S --> T([Dashboards and early-warning alerts])
